，到底意味着什么？ 本期bilibili人文季x《一麦三连》特别策划，邀请到了B站UP主@天真的和感伤的小说家 、北京大学哲学系教授@程乐松 、华东师范大学中文系教授@汤拥华老师 。这三位嘉宾都曾经不约而同地在不同的场合谈论过快乐的话题，也许是重新定义快乐在人生中的位置、也许是为“想不开的人”辩护。或许，我们本质上是在确认，当痛苦和无常必然存在，我们如何与不确定性相处？如果快乐不是人生的必然追求，如何才能锚定人生的价值与意义？看完这期视频，也许会有新的答案。欢迎&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;iframe src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=116402254058744&amp;amp;high_quality=1&amp;amp;autoplay=0" width="650" height="477" scrolling="no" border="0" frameborder="no" framespacing="0" allowfullscreen="true" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/4f6848ecbfb1513faec2d155c4242a8f07d81be1.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1vXQgBEEPX</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1vXQgBEEPX</guid><pubDate>Tue, 14 Apr 2026 10:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>全书恶搞学术圈有多乱 ，笑着笑着就难过了！文学院必看！</title><description>&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;iframe src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=116391181159500&amp;amp;high_quality=1&amp;amp;autoplay=0" width="650" height="477" scrolling="no" border="0" frameborder="no" framespacing="0" allowfullscreen="true" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="http://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/00eda89d3d229378b6319510ab37be913e9602b4.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1ogDQBNEbt</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1ogDQBNEbt</guid><pubDate>Sun, 12 Apr 2026 10:10:54 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>绝了的百香果煮鱼和焦了的泡泡饼</title><description>&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;iframe src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=116323401206809&amp;amp;high_quality=1&amp;amp;autoplay=0" width="650" height="477" scrolling="no" border="0" frameborder="no" framespacing="0" allowfullscreen="true" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="http://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/arc